# Store and check out text files with LF line endings on every machine (Lovable's servers use
# LF). Without this, Windows checkouts get CRLF and files regenerated by the dev server, like
# src/routeTree.gen.ts, show up as changed and block git pull.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
